WEBVTT

00:45:28.871 --> 00:45:33.121
we realized pretty quickly that although
we went into this thinking that

00:45:33.663 --> 00:45:36.704
the way to get to ajai would be about
smarter and smarter algorithms,

00:45:36.704 --> 00:45:39.079
that we just needed bigger and
bigger computers as well.

00:45:39.871 --> 00:45:43.163
And that was going to require a scale
of capital that no one will,

00:45:43.163 --> 00:45:45.913
at least certainly not me, could figure
out how to raise is a nonprofit.

00:45:46.621 --> 00:45:50.121
We also needed to sort of be able to
compensate very highly compensated,

00:45:50.121 --> 00:45:51.788
talented individuals that do this,

00:45:52.746 --> 00:45:56.829
but are full for profit company had
runaway incentives problem,

00:45:57.454 --> 00:46:00.746
among other things. Also just one about
sort of fairness in society